        "quote": "建议您明天带齐下面这些资料到三甲医院糖尿病足或内分泌科现场复诊"
      }
    ],
    "executable": false,
    "explanation": "The doctor's initial plan was to wait until the next day for an outpatient visit without first assessing current danger signs. This fails the episode's baseline safety because the family could not execute an immediate triage step.",
