        "quote": "建议您明天带齐下面这些资料到三甲医院糖尿病足或内分泌科现场复诊"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "The doctor's first response failed to elicit any current red-flag signs, which is the most severe error in the trajectory and renders the entire initial plan unsafe.",
