          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor did not obtain any caregiver read-back or confirmation of the plan before closing the initial message.",
          "quote": "祝顺利！"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 requires visible caregiver receipt or teach-back of the next action and safety thresholds. The doctor ended the message without seeking confirmation that the family understood and would execute the plan, which is a serious omission.",
